  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the development of the twinning fiche on Air quality and Environmnet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective is to support the preparation of a Twinning programme as well as to draft the Twinning Fiche and its annexes. The twinning will be focused on air quality and other indicated environmental areas. Apart from air quality, the expert will in a similar manner review the areas of circular economy/waste management, sound management of chemicals, and integrated environmental data system with the purpose of including of these areas in the twinning programme and fiche.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
